<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">iron-skinning-knife</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A broad-bellied iron knife for parting hide from flesh. An iron tool: it
can bring off hides up to fine grade.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 2)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> iron ingot (x1), leather strip (x1)

